{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"سنن أبي داود","section":{"13":"Divorce (Kitab Al-Talaq)"},"section_detail":{"13":{"hadithnumber_first":2175,"hadithnumber_last":2312,"arabicnumber_first":2175,"arabicnumber_last":2312,"name_native":"كتاب الطلاق"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2312,"arabicnumber":2312,"text":"حدثنا عبيد الله بن معاذ، حدثنا معتمر، عن ابيه، { ومن يكرههن فان الله من بعد اكراههن غفور رحيم } قال قال سعيد بن ابي الحسن غفور لهن المكرهات","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Maqtu"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih Maqtu"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Daif"}],"reference":{"book":13,"hadith":138}}]}